{
  "thought_summary": "需要调查 lcs_length.py 文件中处理连续公共子序列的逻辑，以验证其是否正确处理长度大于一的情况。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": ".",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 10
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "已列出仓库中的文件，下一步需要检查 lcs_length.py 文件中的 DP 表更新逻辑以验证其处理连续公共子序列的能力。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "lcs_length.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 50,
      "max_lines": 100
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "lcs_length.py 中的 DP 表更新逻辑似乎仅在字符匹配时更新 dp[i, j]，但未考虑连续子序列的长度是否大于一。需要进一步验证该逻辑是否正确处理这种情况。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "find_references",
    "arguments": {
      "symbol": "dp",
      "path": "lcs_length.py",
      "include_definitions": true,
      "max_results": 5
    }
  }
}

content:
{
  "thought_summary": "find_references 工具调用失败，因为路径必须指向目录。需要重新检查路径并尝试其他方法来验证 DP 表更新逻辑。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "dp[i, j] = dp[i - 1, j] + 1",
      "path": "lcs_length.py",
      "regex": false,
      "case_sensitive": true,
      "max_results": 5
    }
  }
}
